{
  "id": "A11",
  "goal": "SMC-M03",
  "title": "Research work and its reports: readers first, then report content",
  "why": [
    "M03 adds a second native task kind, research, whose result is a report: one artifact authored in Markdown with versions v1..vN and other formats (a PDF) as renditions of a version (migration 0022). This part is the read side only. Every reader that would refuse a research task, a Markdown report or a rendition learns them before any writer exists (plan §5, readers first).",
    "Old records read exactly as before: a property this amendment adds is omitted when it has no value, never sent as null, so an older Studio or bridge reads every record that existed before M03 unchanged. Records only a later M03 release can write (a research task, a Markdown report, a rendition) need these readers, so that release follows the one carrying them.",
    "A bridge result's kind is any bounded kind name, not a closed list: a bridge acts on the kinds it knows and leaves any other result unannounced, so a later task kind never fails a whole assignment batch.",
    "The runtime command's role pattern and route stay as they are here: they are compiled into the runtime unit, so they change with the research runtime unit (S2), not with these readers.",
    "Report content (part 2): getSourceContent authorizes each read of a report's source or rendition and answers with its hash, size, type and a file name. A text kept inline (at most 256 KiB, source_texts) comes back as text; stored bytes come back as a URL that expires, signed by the API, which alone holds the store's credential (D5). The client checks the bytes it received against the hash before showing or saving them. disposition=attachment makes the URL save the file under its name.",
    "Knowledge (part 2): listReports lists report cards, newest first, from one project or from every project the reader is a member of (L6). It has a format filter and a search over the title, the description and the version notes, never the report bodies. Counts and project names come only from projects the reader can read. listArtifactVersions answers every version of one report with its notes, newest first. The deterministic change facts and the trigger join both reads when publication writes them (S4)."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/format/enum",
      "value": ["html", "pdf", "pptx", "ui", "markdown"]
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/title",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "The artifact's title (at most 180 characters, held by the database)."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/versionNumber",
      "value": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "description": "1 for the first version of the artifact, then 2, 3… Omitted for a version written before numbering."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/createdAt",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date-time"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/renditions",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 8,
        "description": "Other formats of this version, e.g. the PDF of a report's Markdown. Omitted when there is none.",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ArtifactRendition"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactRendition",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One stored format of an artifact version. Its bytes are the source's; the hash is what a download is checked against.",
        "properties": {
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["pdf"]
          },
          "sourceId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "byteLength": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "mime": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pageCount": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 100000
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": ["format", "sourceId", "sha256", "byteLength", "mime", "pageCount"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTask/properties/kind",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["draft_brief", "research"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTask/properties/artifactId",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uuid",
        "description": "The report this task writes into. Omitted until it has one, and always for a brief."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTaskReceipt/properties/kind",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["draft_brief", "research"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTaskDetail/properties/result/anyOf/0/properties/cacheReadTokens",
      "value": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "description": "Input tokens the provider read from its prompt cache. Omitted when the provider did not report it."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTaskDetail/properties/result/anyOf/0/properties/cacheWriteTokens",
      "value": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "description": "Input tokens the provider wrote to its prompt cache. Omitted when the provider did not report it."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/NativeTaskDetail/properties/result/anyOf/0/properties/outputs",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 8,
        "description": "What the task published: each stored format of the report version it produced. Omitted for a brief.",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "artifactVersionId": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "format": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["markdown", "pdf"]
            },
            "sourceId": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "sha256": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
            },
            "byteLength": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 9007199254740991
            },
            "limitations": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 8,
              "description": "What the output says it could not do, in short sentences.",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": ["artifactVersionId", "format", "sourceId", "sha256", "byteLength", "limitations"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/components/schemas/MediaAssignment/properties/results/items/properties/kind",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,39}$",
        "description": "The task's kind (draft_brief, research, …). A bridge announces the kinds it knows and leaves any other result unannounced."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/components/schemas/SourceContent",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One authorized read of a source. Exactly one of text (a text kept inline) and downloadUrl (stored bytes, until expiresAt) is set.",
        "properties": {
          "sourceId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "mime": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "byteLength": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "What a saved copy is called, e.g. sandboxed-pdf-rendering-v2.pdf."
          },
          "disposition": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["inline", "attachment"]
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The source itself, when it is a text kept inline."
          },
          "downloadUrl": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": ["sourceId", "sha256", "mime", "byteLength", "filename", "disposition", "downloadUrl", "expiresAt"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1sources~1{sourceId}~1content/get/parameters/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "disposition",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "inline (the default) to show it; attachment to save it under its file name.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["inline", "attachment"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/changeNote",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "What changed from the previous version, in a sentence. Omitted for a first version and before notes existed."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/retainedNote",
      "value": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "What this version carried over from the previous one. Omitted for a first version."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion/properties/limitations",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 8,
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "What the version says it could not do. Omitted when it says nothing."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ArtifactVersionList",
      "value": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 500,
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ArtifactVersion"
        },
        "description": "Every version of one artifact the reader may see, newest first."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1artifacts~1{artifactId}~1versions/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema",
      "value": {
        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ArtifactVersionList"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ReportCard",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One report as Knowledge lists it: what it is, where it lives, and its latest change.",
        "properties": {
          "artifactId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "projectId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "projectTitle": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "summary": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "summaryAuthorId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "summaryRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "summaryUpdatedAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "currentVersionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "currentVersionNumber": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 9007199254740991
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "versionCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "formats": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 8,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["html", "pdf", "pptx", "ui", "markdown"]
            }
          },
          "latestChange": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "note": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "retained": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": ["note", "retained"]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "artifactId",
          "projectId",
          "projectTitle",
          "title",
          "summary",
          "summaryAuthorId",
          "summaryRevision",
          "summaryUpdatedAt",
          "currentVersionId",
          "currentVersionNumber",
          "versionCount",
          "updatedAt",
          "formats",
          "latestChange"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/ReportList",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "reports": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 50,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReportCard"
            }
          },
          "projects": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 500,
            "description": "Each readable project with reports matching the format and search, and how many.",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "projectId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                },
                "title": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "count": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "maximum": 9007199254740991
                }
              },
              "required": ["projectId", "title", "count"]
            }
          },
          "nextCursor": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,200}$"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": ["reports", "projects", "nextCursor"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1knowledge~1reports",
      "value": {
        "get": {
          "operationId": "listReports",
          "summary": "Reports from one project or every project the reader is a member of, newest first; counts and names only from readable projects.",
          "tags": ["artifacts"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "project",
              "in": "query",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^(all|[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12})$"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "in": "query",
              "required": false,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["any", "pdf", "markdown_only"]
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "q",
              "in": "query",
              "required": false,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 200
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "cursor",
              "in": "query",
              "required": false,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,200}$"
              }
            }
          ],
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Report cards.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReportList"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Invalid input",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
